m_1 \times L_1 = m_2 \times L_2

A physical balance beam with adjustable weights allows future readers to feel equality through equilibrium, not just see it.

3. Crystalline Geometry Ratios: Fundamental geometric relationships are cut into stone as 3D relief forms that can be traced by hand, establishing a tactile-auditory-visual correspondence.

