A critical gap identified in Draft v0.3 was the assumption that future decoders possess primitive laboratory equipment (thermometers, pressure gauges, electrical cells). Draft v0.4 acknowledges that the archive must teach how to construct such instruments from raw materials available at pre-industrial technological levels.

The construction of measurement devices follows a strict pedagogical sequence:

