To counteract non-uniform spatial erasure fields, the channel code combines a low-overhead Spatial Fountain Code (e.g., Raptor codes) at the global layer with Low-Density Parity-Check (LDPC) codes mapped through a deterministic multi-scale spatial interleaver $\Pi_{\text{spatial}}$.

